{"title":"Stronger than you","artist":"Steven Universe","sourceId":"reference:lcCJfB08VDF5FLNsu72G","sourceHash":"6338a22ec6c353a10f931a5c799640dc7e36ea6749742c92af91eb251bc2dd8f","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":17982258,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":9.79,"end":11.38,"text":"This is Garnet","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":11.38,"end":12.4,"text":"Back together","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":12.4,"end":15.79,"text":"And I'm never going down at the hands of the likes of you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":15.79,"end":17.57,"text":"Because I'm so much better","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":17.57,"end":19.74,"text":"And every part of me is saying \"go get her\"","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":19.74,"end":22.19,"text":"The two of us ain't gonna follow your rules","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":22.19,"end":24.79,"text":"Come at me without any of your fancy tools","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":24.79,"end":27.03,"text":"Let's go, just me and you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":27.03,"end":29.1,"text":"Let's go, just one on two","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":29.1,"end":31.76,"text":"Go ahead and try and hit me if you're able","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":31.76,"end":34.09,"text":"Can't you see that my relationship is stable?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":34.09,"end":36.57,"text":"I can see you hate the way we intermingle","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":36.57,"end":38.89,"text":"But I think you're just mad 'cause you're single","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":38.89,"end":41.04,"text":"And you're not gonna stop what we made together","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":41.04,"end":43.2,"text":"We are gonna stay like this forever","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":43.2,"end":45.61,"text":"If you break us apart we'll just come back newer","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":45.61,"end":48.49,"text":"And we'll always be twice the gem that you are","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":48.49,"end":52.01,"text":"I am made o-o-o-o-of","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":52.01,"end":54.52,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":54.52,"end":59.2,"text":"O-o-o-o-of","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":59.2,"end":61.93,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":61.93,"end":64.35,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":64.35,"end":68.9,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":68.9,"end":71.72,"text":"Mm-mm-mm-mm-mm","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":71.72,"end":74.02,"text":"Mm-mm-mm-mm-mm","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":74.02,"end":77.47,"text":"Mm-mm-mm-mm-mm","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":87.85,"end":90.52,"text":"This is who we are","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":90.52,"end":93.06,"text":"This is who I am","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":93.06,"end":95.2,"text":"And if you think you can stop me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":95.2,"end":97.78999999999999,"text":"Then you need to think again","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":97.78999999999999,"end":100.25,"text":"'Cause I am a feeling","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":100.25,"end":102.58,"text":"And I will never end","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":102.58,"end":104.69,"text":"And I won't let you hurt my planet","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":104.69,"end":107.25,"text":"And I won't let you hurt my friends","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":107.25,"end":109.84,"text":"Go ahead and try and hit me if you're able!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":109.84,"end":112.44,"text":"Can't you see that my relationship is stable?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":112.44,"end":114.84,"text":"I know you think I'm not something you're afraid of","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":114.84,"end":117.14,"text":"'Cause you think that you've seen what I'm made of","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":117.14,"end":119.47999999999999,"text":"Well, I am even more than the two of them!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":119.47999999999999,"end":121.84,"text":"Everything they care about is what I am!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":121.84,"end":124.71,"text":"I am their fury, I am their patience","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":124.71,"end":126.97,"text":"I am a conversation!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":126.97,"end":130.32,"text":"I am made o-o-o-o-of","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":130.32,"end":132.73,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":132.73,"end":135.84,"text":"O-o-o-o-of","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":135.84,"end":137.86,"text":"And it's stronger than you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":137.86,"end":140.47,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":140.47,"end":142.89,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":142.89,"end":145.78,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":145.78,"end":147.63,"text":"And it's stronger than you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":147.63,"end":150.12,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":150.12,"end":152.57999999999998,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":152.57999999999998,"end":155.48,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":155.48,"end":157.31,"text":"And it's stronger than you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":157.31,"end":160.0,"text":"O-o-o-o-of","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":160.0,"end":162.47,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":162.47,"end":163.8,"text":"Lo-o-o-o-ove","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}